      "uid": "zhcn:4a225d001862ffb108bedd69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "才・能・爆・发♡\n感受到了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4380ec280cdc23e97e56f59b65456c9cea6eddd1c87c938deba137422f8f633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:347820a6ef690460eb22d413",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦看着吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4b761d2c6eaecf567334a9be4a446c13a4dd70a8caf766a8fc9df1c20075c88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00523bbaae7887f6549b2ff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可别小看了天才啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1a35170141e0d51ac1791dba9d4084b971e70d609e2b759a474c2b1ca18c2cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679a08a9d187716b2311aeff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "玩浆板对吧？去逛街，\r\n再去海边游泳～…诶等等。时间\r\n不是根本不够吗？喂快点去海边啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6e73c0b3419728fdf219c0de9b1f53b94dddaa8237b13d54d95fc9cb77036e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f73a520f7a57ee2bb2b772f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿～♡和小杏的合照\r\n发到UmaTok上去吧～。…啊果然还是算啦。\r\n这可是只属于人家的独家记忆呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "49fd0a88134cc08160dc12382b89c3f943d6dd223ed87e74950c5bca207d6675",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7a78f975f91f5e4da0c8b7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用那么努力也轻轻松松~♪\n不・过・呢……天才少女的潜力☆\n你是不是很想看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf805a3a4784259aab9bd2875d5e76d19a1619462a44e74510304ff2501d052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d09463bf30a77945ec2245cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说这是活动任务诶～\r\n嘛，感兴趣的时候再做呗？啊，说起来\r\n快看我的美甲～♡ 感觉是不是超棒？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c42c137118fb37f5b343d4f994629ce296c48d307909da390dc681920f3fe274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b1197ddf8d7761038fac240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦～☆诶，这不是\r\n超努力了吗？是不是也太棒了？\r\n送你一个飞吻～。啾哇♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f49277d8a7bf62b2a35231553cc226103bd2c797e04d7ec60bf0990e1ad78f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9813bf51704d12a25b3012a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起来创造最棒的回忆吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3492f3bff643cfa469e389f40c098f1f01ddd7ee1ec9987581b43263e8ebd330",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3029f1770b4403985b144828",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是度假！就得欢闹起来才对吧！？\n呐呐，你也是！可不准拒绝哦~！\n……下次再一起来吧♪嘻嘻♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fd00d0b115ea8a90b3cee8c51b1eb57c17c799477d97fea84068de4e508212",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
