    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ca718ff868164b09156b0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇啊啊啊啊啊~……早上好~\n今天也谢谢你的起床电话。\n……明天也拜托了♡呐~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "c764ea95740b61d29e16fd25979303984650380b98b485c6a077d5c46aa77244",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:777f7de45b9a5603a7f9a08b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好~！……呐！\n快看快看我今天的超好状态！\n很天才吧？很天才吧~~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc0b684b0f0d80a88a195e939309d7a2026a9e5f85ab4f4b7ca34fb5a09bdc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:828f26d1965b49b3239aa7a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜欸欸~训练员救救我！\n小心心要把我带到山上去~！明明\n只是让她帮我脱了一下衣服而已~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f89650e73bf436fe76ab8ac7001a85fb765119fd519bebbcbfc067a06a40482",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b4a98aac71c8524170ae5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶~？训练~？\n现在很困就不去了~\n你要是愿意带我去的话也行哦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d54a41597234db49632831bd08b60338727a3f4d6d79274d46d993597f91c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3981d17ca87f62d28844f57f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊~今天也超努力的！作为奖励\n来拆一套高档化妆品好了~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "956cb7866b3b61e06b089351b1d6ac07950f188cffe163fe9271d29c5e357aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54f14d25b8ec689214c09184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……课程作业？\n没事的♡\n只要做起来就能马上完成♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5e5fd41e9d3246d367b519748c084f5a07626dd20ae0357d2e991814e32887",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5742b251c3594f4952dbfe67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~你知道小茵前辈吗？\n……真是的~一到这个季节\n她就马上会跑去晒太阳~",
      "source_fingerprint": "edb64bff6bfb49d593eccfd0a92c19638d583982e1a14d77f35b58d6afd41299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e929503a00456d384c83f5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热~~！要化了~~！\n今天就做室内训练行吗~！\n呐~~~拜托啦~~~~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d30edcb0a5afb94cfc357aa8eb96d3f712a9f453709faada53de66c59e60492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:625636239beacca1925b8d4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "话说有没有想吃芋头？毕竟秋天了！\n栗子也可以~总之，去喝下午茶吧！\n好就这么定了♡♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e696a9baed3efbc6aa3eaaf62ffb0b901246ad90f8d2cc910c4b941c8450b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3493952d33cd3b27283f3b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……冷！要、要冻僵了……！\n……呐，训练员！那个……\n今天要不改为室内训练吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb7bb307682924b33cf466b6161ad5e6d00e7abc1e2ceb5fde43ad788857c76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d399f0eae52030c0d52ec61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝活很流行啊~我试着做了瑜伽♪\n……毕竟都这么努力了~\n吃个薄煎饼悠闲度过吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f9a663ddc0270717940694eb740af3b9adc8c6129202a28a93376ccbb42b98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76637267df5d765850da5269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哇~……呐，要不来做一下冥想吧？\n好像有大人物说过冥想有利于健康呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8483832d24eb6c7e2acbb4658e8d3889917eda3abba0f9bd7b53aef36a9475b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcb5bc74d2e016aded62d55f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放学后~先要去拍大头贴吧？\n然后是吃吃可丽饼，打打保龄球~\n……在那之前要先训练？哈诶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59769994ba88d62233d5a29486e2465c5d79c366d4faf46165d7f1629d13ecaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94e7b984d1f4577cbc17ddbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的课好烦人啊。\n啊，帮我准备点高级水果\n和珍珠奶茶吧。上完课就去找你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64effe2769bfc9d7eb12c669bcb422db155e0d97e9d380043981f725d44d933d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0618729b03ea88c8469ca56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗完澡用来吃的冰淇淋没有啦~\n呜欸~！这样下去我会动不了……\n动不了的呢~偷瞄♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "895d62e750d0706ca3ede29f4042b0c35fa0109a7490c0c50bf80b97e48f133d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb863558720fde6db13a8e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜。小心心她啊，老是作业作业的……\n啊，对了！用揉肩和美式点心\n让她放过我吧~",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c446cd1ba284c4efec16186a3d4f9c2ef678b2a0152ee3772467a5adaa5262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f4f2fa54a31a0940862f605",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小茵前辈去赏花了，\n回过神来已经一起大睡了，\n我们总是会这样呢！呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5030a19505953dcf41e17402e3d1c47479bf5a4e27a9418903a77656d5101c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2491ae06b7046fcfa38c50c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要来我的私人海滩吗？\n有超~漂亮的大海，\n别墅里还有游艇哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b75dbf14699552c977ed61eb0bbd4358e66b916e02f9eeb76d9b20128f4ba407",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f30d6ec94e22d40612bd2925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "话说——最近连秋天都很热啊~！\n难道说季节会减少？……管它呢，\n反正还能穿泳装也不错！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "775f915d1b36f4d2427ee699f38b5880ab4992d962f6a294ca8d633baebc8d2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4912c4da806282342caf5e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想在雪屋里装枝形吊灯~\n还要放上梳妆台！所以……\n要做个又大又结实的哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "405b5ca9a772a1d2d9a724292231e138db8093cb13fe56c68096cb46d84a2ef3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0e621f612cc303e246032bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ffa58a82ebf8bcdc733cb49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be7254e12a96153ca740e582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎~真是搞不懂宝穴前辈！\n明明自己动不动就喜欢拍肩膀，\n为什么就讨厌抱抱呢~！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44bafb2f454597d35755973197956e6ece7eb99ae2d055cc8a907351f90b730d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4319641e47cd38509132a5af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小目的便当到手~♡\n吃了这个我的天才力就能提升♪\n下次休息日再让她帮我做好了♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "8086845d257ad8448bb118bf252b56f0fb30c0c7b7e42cbe099250714ab96076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed4dc6b0f27ec06e705e2667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽又闪闪发光的东西\n我都超~~~~喜欢♡♡\n公主战士的联名化妆品我绝对要买♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e2a2c5ad7d9c9b7634424afce39d139eefd59054e60aead680868e7d1ef3a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7228997a150461129c49769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~你知道我的耳机跑哪去了吗？\n真是糟透了……我超喜欢这副耳机的\n……嘛，再去买一副就行了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "25442bd0ee3fc94d28a04d4629d5a08370c687ffc22d5751b9e77a9c9ce86e6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692edb1b2d97acde65a484b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？别因为\n人家可爱就看得这么入迷啦~♡\n……欸不是吗？别害羞嘛~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c62eb9db594a986f48aa127a7e9c99f35f8763986dddda0a1581229fa3791eff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3716dbd934a36d5b43652ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？很合适吧~♡♡\n虽然会更喜欢更华丽一点的……\n不过我长得这么天才完全没问题♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "012329b45743968956323073daf3d53473ff4f1dddafae358ce41d7d7c46dc81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2845489955aa22086eb1d4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得有配套衣服~\n想找人一起拍个Umatok呢♪\n欸嘿嘿~要找谁呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "106ee4154d691dbe1e84bed9a2df2b63cf44fe1d7a0f0ae27277300ffce9aab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef8e8b321e5a024cb9f68cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿~这套决胜服真天才♡\n袖子的透明感~花边和蝴蝶结~\n还有身为设计者的我全都很天才♡♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb06074a2ab9c1371f8883b76b45bcdf483cdf1e13cfbe8be4c71e5ca90f8344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:947ccc418f68d213ac92146a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜~太失败了！\n装饰做得太多了啦~~！！\n清洗时要一个个取下来麻烦死了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b11c5cb013c393bc4d78e255651cecad73dac6917f0a02c414d609e9b836909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3199b13b18d46fbd6757bdc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真是的~干嘛啦。\n早上起来脸肿了，\n不过肿了也很可爱就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f88705863b8b9d2adf47af8694780927d5273ea2b77c7e29a83709c1dff793c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47fbc4e89188d7829e1ed6eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇啊啊啊啊啊啊。\n……嗯~好想午睡。\n去训练员室睡好了~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02b984fa1e45f00345b464df0d25ac0b3fcc4f5587487389c73277d5da1fdd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e6b52d67012b70e7c067727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼、哼、哼！\n能赢过本天才少女潘多拉酱吗~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f257f4b4c46cb5edb06a54c5d319e5b04e624e202bd57878d5ebd357ffc216b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "910100"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
